  eventID: ExperimentForce
  dialogueLines:
  - "Okay, you\u2019re deliberately avoiding the experiment room just to annoy me.
    Fine. I\u2019ll put you there myself."
  - "So you\u2019re refusing to go to the experiment room on purpose. Alright then.
    I\u2019ll take care of it for you."
  - "You\u2019re clearly avoiding the experiment room just to be difficult. Fine.
    If you won\u2019t go there, I\u2019ll send you there myself."
  - "Oh, you\u2019re doing this deliberately. You keep avoiding the experiment room,
    so I\u2019m going to make the decision for you."
  - "You\u2019ve had plenty of chances to go to the experiment room. Since you refuse,
    I\u2019ll just move you there myself."
